\subsubsection{Dataset preparation}
We used the official evaluation scripts provided by the DARPA organizers to produce the results reported in this work. To do so, we converted the evaluation set (which we refer to as test set) and the training set (which we refer to as in-domain set) to text data in order to be compatible with the DARPA scripts.

\subsection{Visual Tasks}
\begin{itemize}
	\item Visual Comprehension: Given a picture with some textual context, answer an accompanying question. For instance, the question ```Which one of the two cars is red?" might go with the image ```Car 1, Car 2" and an image of two cars, where one is red.
	\item Visual Question Answering: Given a question and an image, find the answer to the question.
	\item Visual Dialog: Given a series of images, each with some textual context, answer the subsequent questions.



